            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The way it was, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like it is now, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a bright, bright summer day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;That's a promise, right?&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl in a white dress said. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunny sky. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A paper plane slid across it, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >riding on blue winds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Season of 12 colors&quot; is a Healing Visual Novel Series: four independent short stories around the same theme. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Summer:Message on the Paper Plane&quot; is the first chapter released. The other three chapters will be released later as DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Paper Plane&quot; is a partly nonlinear story about childhood memories. Collecting all pieces from different point-of-view, then the truth will emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our second project, if you are interested in our other works, please visit Creator Home Page~</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--The way it was, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like it is now, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a bright, bright summer day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;That's a promise, right?&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl in a white dress said. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunny sky. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A paper plane slid across it, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >riding on blue winds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >============================================== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Season of 12 colors&quot; is a Healing Visual Novel Series: four independent short stories around the same theme. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Summer:Message on the Paper Plane&quot; is the first chapter released. The other three chapters will be released later as DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Paper Plane&quot; is a partly nonlinear story about childhood memories. Collecting all pieces from different point-of-view, then the truth will emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our second project, if you are interested in our other works, please visit Creator Home Page~</p>",
